<h3>2026-08-31 — HDRY TPU gasket pieces in inventory, BOMs, queue</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Added six printable TPU gasket SKUs (3&times;3 mm section, lengths 215/150/180/358/378/1582 mm) as <code>3d_printed</code> items, attached them to both HDRY unit BOMs (base P36787 + add-on P36788), set adhesive <code>HW-GASKET-6X3</code> optional as tape fallback, registered STLs under <code>/data/nfs/3d/models/gasket/</code>, and queued one job set per unit (filament PM-TPU90).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Replace kit adhesive tape with printable TPU strips sized to dryer channels; make-or-buy and print queue need inventory + BOM + jobs.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>hdry_work/gasket/*</code>, <code>Comserv/script/hdry_gasket_queue.pl</code>, STLs on NFS; inventory/BOM/job rows via API + RemoteDB.</p>
